field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106068","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106068.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106068.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The long anticipated `StringName` version of #100132!\r\n\r\nI do not expect any comparable improvements to #100132 because the bottleneck is elsewhere (though small improvements _are_ expected).\r\nHowever, I think this is an important step in the right direction, because we need `StringName` construction from `Span<char>` if we want to slowly make `Span<char>` the default way of passing around static strings (for its speed benefits over `const char *`).\r\n\r\nThis need can already be seen in `assign_class_name_static`, where I forgot that `StringName(const char*)` checks null termination, so the function is _technically_ incorrect right now (though it will never fail because all callers currently use null terminated `Span`).\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106068/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106068/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}